<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE IV</span>: </span><span id="S4.T4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Ablation studies on data recipes and reward design. We evaluate the impact of using template-based data (T.B.) <span id="S4.T4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">vs.</span> LLM-rewritten data (Rewritten.), and the individual effects of five reward functions.
Tool. and Param. denote the tool invocation reward and parameter content reward.
The last column reports the average accuracy (%) across geometric reasoning benchmarks described in Sec. <a href="#S4.SS1" title="IV-A Spatial and Geometry Reasoning Benchmarks ‣ IV Experiments ‣ TIGeR: Tool-Integrated Geometric Reasoning in Vision-Language Models for Robotics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">IV-A</span></a>.
</span></figcaption>
